        "x = 8"
      ],
      "answer_index": 1,
      "hint": "",
      "solution": "Let log_2(x) = y. Then 1/y + y = 2 => y^2 - 2y + 1 = 0 => (y-1)^2 = 0 => y = 1. Hence, log_2(x) = 1 => x = 2^1 = 2. Index 1."
